WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:05,100
Assistant Ruan, I plan to buy a plane and a yacht.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,100
Where should I buy this thing?

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:11,660
Boss, which one do you want to buy?

4
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:14,880
Entry-level business jets cost tens of millions

5
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:18,330
Top long-range business jets cost hundreds of millions

6
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,730
Deep customization is more expensive

7
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:22,130
The gap between the upper and lower parts of the yacht gradually becomes larger

8
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:25,920
So be it

9
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:29,180
What is the approximate range of your asset grade?

10
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,380
A9 or A10

11
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,700
AWhat?

12
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:37,000
A9 Assets from 100 million to 1 billion

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,600
A10 billion to tens of billions
